    "Name": "Cataphract CTF-5L",
    "Details": "Originally a FrankenMech produced with components sourced from 3 different Mechs, the 70 ton Cataphract entered Cappellan service in 3025. Powered by a 280-rated Fusion Core, the Cataphract 5L is armored in Reflective Armor. Armed with a Gauss Rifle and an ER PPC, the Cataphract 5L mounts a pair of Medium lasers and a pair of Small VSPL’s for close combat. \n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Protected Actuators</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.1</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limit: Right Lower</color>",
